message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "ito-temporal-absorber: time-varying ITO films on a mirror against the Rozanov bound"
version: 1.1.0
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/Wasif312/ito-temporal-absorber"
url: "https://github.com/Wasif312/ito-temporal-absorber"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-10-24
authors:
  - family-names: Hussain
    given-names: Muhammad Wasif
    affiliation: "Department of Physics, Superior Groups of Colleges (Campus for University Programs), Mandi Bahauddin 50400, Pakistan"
    email: m.wasif.physcholar@gmail.com
